  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: ConnectionProvider returns to its minimal abstract shape (Open / BeginTransaction). ConnectionInfo and configuration concerns move to ConfigurationConnectionProvider. Commands now carry their compile-time dialect as a typed Backend DU (RzSQL / SQLite / TSQL / Postgres) rather than a string, parsed at the rzsql.json boundary and threaded through everywhere else. Breaking change for custom ConnectionProvider subclasses: Open now takes (connectionName : string, backend : Backend). See CHANGELOG.md for the full 1.0.0 story.",
